OL,3,GNEWSAHealey announces #100 energy
OL,4,Apayment for millions and bank tax rise
OL,5,Ain first Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FBanks will pay an extra 3% on the banks
OL,8,Fsurcharge, which will be "time-limited"
OL,9,F- a smaller tax rise than expected
OL,11,FHealey says there will be "fiscal
OL,12,Fdevolution", with business rates
OL,13,Fretained locally by the end of the
OL,14,Fdecade and mayors getting a share of
OL,15,Fincome tax from 2028
OL,17,FA smaller rise in minimum wage for
OL,18,Fyoung workers is confirmed, with those
OL,19,Faged 18 to 20 seeing it go up by 3.9%
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
